    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "The effect triggers \"when this Digimon would digivolve,\" so it occurs after declaring the digivolution, but before paying the digivolution cost.",
        "question": "When this card's [Your Turn] effect activates and I <Recovery +1 (Deck)>, when exactly does this happen?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, it does.",
        "question": "Does this card’s [Your Turn] effect also activate when DNA digivolving?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, this card's effect reads \"when this Digimon would digivolve\", so it activates. In that case, the effect activates even if the digivolution fails, so the <Recovery +1 (Deck)> activates.",
        "question": "If I have 3 or fewer security cards and this Digimon would digivolve, but the digivolution cost can no longer be paid due to the inherited effect of my opponent's [EX3-016 SnowAgumon], [EX3-019 Paledramon] or other cards and the digivolution fails, can this card's <Recovery +1 (Deck)> activate?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      }
    ]
